Panna Reader

Rebuilt from the user-supplied CloudReader-master.zip.
Original project: CloudReader, https://github.com/youlookwhat/CloudReader
Original attribution: Copyright (C) 2016 Bin Jing
Original license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (retained in LICENSE).

This distribution substantially changes the original project: the feed/MVVM
application is replaced by a native offline text library. All application Java
classes, visual resources, app package and module names are new. The Gradle
wrapper scripts/JAR and Apache license are retained. The original upstream
source and assets are not bundled in this rebuilt source archive.

The Gradle wrapper is a third-party build component. Its existing copyright
notices remain in the retained scripts/JAR. Renaming the product does not
transfer ownership of upstream work.

Version 1.1 adds device TTS integration, named bookmarks, incoming text sharing,
single-reading TXT exports, sepia theme, keep-awake preference and library totals.

Version 1.2 adds reversible Trash, pin/archive states, tag browsing, notes exports,
non-overwriting backup merge and schema 2 backups with schema 1 read compatibility.

Version 1.3 adds saved passage highlights with annotations, lightweight Markdown
heading navigation, filtered multi-selection and batch organization, enriched
study-note exports, and schema 3 backups with schema 1/2 read compatibility.

Version 1.4 adds manually entered source metadata, multiple collection memberships,
bounded advanced literal search, catalog CSV exports and schema 4 backups with
schema 1/2/3 read compatibility.
